        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.1+1SA.31.2+1SA.31.3+1SA.31.4+1SA.31.5+1SA.31.6+1SA.31.7+1SA.31.8+1SA.31.9+1SA.31.10+1SA.31.11+1SA.31.12+1SA.31.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Now the Philistines fought against Israel; and the men of Israel fled before the Philistines, and fell slain on Mount Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Philistines overtook Saul and his sons; and the Philistines slew Jonathan and Abinadab and Malchishua, the sons of Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The battle pressed hard upon Saul, and the archers found him; and he was wounded by the archers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Saul said to his armor-bearer, “Draw your sword, and thrust me through with it, lest these uncircumcised come and make sport of me.” But his armor-bearer would not; for he feared greatly. Therefore Saul took his own sword, and fell upon it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when his armor-bearer saw that Saul was dead, he also fell upon his sword, and died. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus Saul died; he and his three sons and all his house died together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when all the men of Israel who were in the valley saw that the army",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10.7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "they",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " had fled and that Saul and his sons were dead, they forsook their cities and fled; and the Philistines came and dwelt in them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the morrow, when the Philistines came to strip the slain, they found Saul and his sons fallen on Mount Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they stripped him and took his head and his armor, and sent messengers throughout the land of the Philistines, to carry the good news to their idols and to the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they put his armor in the temple of their gods, and fastened his head in the temple of Dagon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when all Jabesh-gilead heard all that the Philistines had done to Saul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the valiant men arose, and took away the body of Saul and the bodies of his sons, and brought them to Jabesh. And they buried their bones under the oak in Jabesh, and fasted seven days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Saul died for his unfaithfulness; he was unfaithful to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in that he did not keep the command of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and also consulted a medium, seeking guidance, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and did not seek guidance from the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Therefore the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " slew him, and turned the kingdom over to David the son of Jesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
